mbers. Eight audits were completed this year with 24 recommendations made. Yet audit recommendations from 2021/22 remain unresolved, with the internal auditor referring to moderate and low-risk issues with the council's controls and procedures from these earlier audits still being outstanding. These represent actions, the auditor confirmed, that management continues to work on.","iso":"2026-09-17","paper_title":"Audit and Governance - 24 June 2026","paper_url":"https://south-derbys.cmis.uk.com/South-Derbys/Document.ashx?czJKcaeAi5tUFL1DTL2UE4zNRBcoShgo=fFLZAbTfgaxD9sfozVo2RiXMHATyQm%2baNFg8BQRQPxd9jUf%2f%2bd9mKA%3d%3d&amp;rUzwRPf%2bZ3zd4E7Ikn8Lyw%3d%3d=pwRE6AGJFLDNlh225F5QMaQWCtPHwdhUfCZ%2fLUQzgA2uL5jNRG4jdQ%3d%3d&amp;mCTIbCubSFfXsDGW9IXnlg%3d%3d=hFflUdN3100%3d&amp;kCx1AnS9%2fpWZQ40DXFvdEw%3d%3d=hFflUdN3100%3d&amp;uJovDxwdjMPoYv%2bAJvYtyA%3d%3d=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;FgPlIEJYlotS%2bYGoBi5olA%3d%3d=NHdURQburHA%3d&amp;d9Qjj0ag1Pd993jsyOJqFvmyB7X0CSQK=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;WGewmoAfeNR9xqBux0r1Q8Za60lavYmz=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;WGewmoAfeNQ16B2MHuCpMRKZMwaG1PaO=ctNJFf55vVA%3d","byline":"PWLBintel \u00b7 from committee papers","draft":true}],"findings":[{"iso":"2026-09-17","committee":"17 September 2026","paper_title":"Audit and Governance - 24 June 2026","paper_url":"https://south-derbys.cmis.uk.com/South-Derbys/Document.ashx?czJKcaeAi5tUFL1DTL2UE4zNRBcoShgo=fFLZAbTfgaxD9sfozVo2RiXMHATyQm%2baNFg8BQRQPxd9jUf%2f%2bd9mKA%3d%3d&amp;rUzwRPf%2bZ3zd4E7Ikn8Lyw%3d%3d=pwRE6AGJFLDNlh225F5QMaQWCtPHwdhUfCZ%2fLUQzgA2uL5jNRG4jdQ%3d%3d&amp;mCTIbCubSFfXsDGW9IXnlg%3d%3d=hFflUdN3100%3d&amp;kCx1AnS9%2fpWZQ40DXFvdEw%3d%3d=hFflUdN3100%3d&amp;uJovDxwdjMPoYv%2bAJvYtyA%3d%3d=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;FgPlIEJYlotS%2bYGoBi5olA%3d%3d=NHdURQburHA%3d&amp;d9Qjj0ag1Pd993jsyOJqFvmyB7X0CSQK=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;WGewmoAfeNR9xqBux0r1Q8Za60lavYmz=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;WGewmoAfeNQ16B2MHuCpMRKZMwaG1PaO=ctNJFf55vVA%3d","headline":"Multiple audit recommendations remain overdue, with moderate and low-risk issues still outstanding from 2021/22.","detail":"The report notes that some audit action due dates have passed, with revised dates now being tracked. Moderate and low-risk governance and control issues dating back to 2021/22 remain unresolved. The Internal Auditor confirmed these reflect outstanding revised actions that management continues to engage with.","category":"governance","matters":"Unresolved audit actions from over three years ago suggest the council has persistent implementation challenges in addressing identified control weaknesses.","figures":"Issues outstanding from 2021/22 still not closed","quote":"He noted that some due dates had passed and that status updates and revised action dates had been provided. He also referred to moderate and low-risk issues dating back to 2021/22.","material":true},{"iso":"2026-09-17","committee":"17 September 2026","paper_title":"Audit and Governance - 24 June 2026","paper_url":"https://south-derbys.cmis.uk.com/South-Derbys/Document.ashx?czJKcaeAi5tUFL1DTL2UE4zNRBcoShgo=fFLZAbTfgaxD9sfozVo2RiXMHATyQm%2baNFg8BQRQPxd9jUf%2f%2bd9mKA%3d%3d&amp;rUzwRPf%2bZ3zd4E7Ikn8Lyw%3d%3d=pwRE6AGJFLDNlh225F5QMaQWCtPHwdhUfCZ%2fLUQzgA2uL5jNRG4jdQ%3d%3d&amp;mCTIbCubSFfXsDGW9IXnlg%3d%3d=hFflUdN3100%3d&amp;kCx1AnS9%2fpWZQ40DXFvdEw%3d%3d=hFflUdN3100%3d&amp;uJovDxwdjMPoYv%2bAJvYtyA%3d%3d=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;FgPlIEJYlotS%2bYGoBi5olA%3d%3d=NHdURQburHA%3d&amp;d9Qjj0ag1Pd993jsyOJqFvmyB7X0CSQK=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;WGewmoAfeNR9xqBux0r1Q8Za60lavYmz=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;WGewmoAfeNQ16B2MHuCpMRKZMwaG1PaO=ctNJFf55vVA%3d","headline":"Internal audit capacity remains under pressure and the council is relying on external associates to fill gaps rather than permanent staff.","detail":"The Internal Auditor reported that capacity had remained an issue with previous resource pressures documented. To manage this, the council developed an associate pool as an alternative to agency support, supported by Lighthouse. However, the process has been lengthy with ongoing challenges around host system access and onboarding of external auditors.","category":"governance","matters":"A resource-constrained audit function reduces the council's ability to provide comprehensive financial control assurance and detect problems in financial management.","figures":"Eight audits completed; 24 recommendations made","quote":"capacity had remained an issue and reminded the Committee that previous resource pressures had been reported. He explained that the market had been slow and that an associate pool had been developed as an alternative to costly agency support. He noted that the process had been lengthy, with Lighthouse supporting the internal shortfall, and that there had been challenges relating to access to host systems and onboarding.","material":true},{"iso":"2026-09-09","committee":"09 September 2026","paper_title":"RISK MANAGEMENT UPDATE QUARTER 1 2026-2027","paper_url":"https://south-derbys.cmis.uk.com/South-Derbys/Document.ashx?czJKcaeAi5tUFL1DTL2UE4zNRBcoShgo=41CfxrlNv6a2%2fq3duqJSILio5zAIX4MHt1aAf81J93b4iODzWRcqLw%3d%3d&amp;rUzwRPf%2bZ3zd4E7Ikn8Lyw%3d%3d=pwRE6AGJFLDNlh225F5QMaQWCtPHwdhUfCZ%2fLUQzgA2uL5jNRG4jdQ%3d%3d&amp;mCTIbCubSFfXsDGW9IXnlg%3d%3d=hFflUdN3100%3d&amp;kCx1AnS9%2fpWZQ40DXFvdEw%3d%3d=hFflUdN3100%3d&amp;uJovDxwdjMPoYv%2bAJvYtyA%3d%3d=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;FgPlIEJYlotS%2bYGoBi5olA%3d%3d=NHdURQburHA%3d&amp;d9Qjj0ag1Pd993jsyOJqFvmyB7X0CSQK=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;WGewmoAfeNR9xqBux0r1Q8Za60lavYmz=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;WGewmoAfeNQ16B2MHuCpMRKZMwaG1PaO=ctNJFf55vVA%3d","headline":"Project management and transformation capacity gaps are now identified as organizational risk factors.","detail":"SR4 (Organisational/Transformational Change) now explicitly lists 'service capacity and project management capacity and capability across the organisation' as risk causes. The council is developing a Project Management Framework and revising its Transformation Work Programme for committee approval in September 2026.","category":"governance","matters":"The council is acknowledging gaps in transformation execution capacity. If project management capability cannot support both operations and LGR transition simultaneously, this creates material risk of service failure or financial mismanagement during 2027-2028.","figures":"Revised work programme due September 2026","quote":"The risk cause has been updated to include service capacity and project management capacity and capability across the organisation.","material":true},{"iso":"2026-09-09","committee":"09 September 2026","paper_title":"RISK MANAGEMENT UPDATE QUARTER 1 2026-2027","paper_url":"https://south-derbys.cmis.uk.com/South-Derbys/Document.ashx?czJKcaeAi5tUFL1DTL2UE4zNRBcoShgo=41CfxrlNv6a2%2fq3duqJSILio5zAIX4MHt1aAf81J93b4iODzWRcqLw%3d%3d&amp;rUzwRPf%2bZ3zd4E7Ikn8Lyw%3d%3d=pwRE6AGJFLDNlh225F5QMaQWCtPHwdhUfCZ%2fLUQzgA2uL5jNRG4jdQ%3d%3d&amp;mCTIbCubSFfXsDGW9IXnlg%3d%3d=hFflUdN3100%3d&amp;kCx1AnS9%2fpWZQ40DXFvdEw%3d%3d=hFflUdN3100%3d&amp;uJovDxwdjMPoYv%2bAJvYtyA%3d%3d=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;FgPlIEJYlotS%2bYGoBi5olA%3d%3d=NHdURQburHA%3d&amp;d9Qjj0ag1Pd993jsyOJqFvmyB7X0CSQK=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;WGewmoAfeNR9xqBux0r1Q8Za60lavYmz=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;WGewmoAfeNQ16B2MHuCpMRKZMwaG1PaO=ctNJFf55vVA%3d","headline":"Staffing and resource risks are escalating as the LGR transition window approaches.","detail":"SR9 (Insufficient resources due to unplanned/unforeseen absences/vacancies) shows significant escalation in risk scores. The council is tasking HR to work with Heads of Service to identify potential resource implications for service delivery through 31 March 2028.","category":"people","matters":"Rising staffing risks during major structural transition could constrain financial controls, change management, and core service delivery. For a lender, this signals potential management capacity constraints during the critical LGR transition period.","figures":"The inherent risk scoring has increased from 9 to 12 and the mitigated risk score increased from 4 to 9.","quote":"The risk score has been revised upwards to reflect the increased likelihood/impact as LGR vesting day approaches.","material":true},{"iso":"2026-09-09","committee":"09 September 2026","paper_title":"RISK MANAGEMENT UPDATE QUARTER 1 2026-2027","paper_url":"https://south-derbys.cmis.uk.com/South-Derbys/Document.ashx?czJKcaeAi5tUFL1DTL2UE4zNRBcoShgo=41CfxrlNv6a2%2fq3duqJSILio5zAIX4MHt1aAf81J93b4iODzWRcqLw%3d%3d&amp;rUzwRPf%2bZ3zd4E7Ikn8Lyw%3d%3d=pwRE6AGJFLDNlh225F5QMaQWCtPHwdhUfCZ%2fLUQzgA2uL5jNRG4jdQ%3d%3d&amp;mCTIbCubSFfXsDGW9IXnlg%3d%3d=hFflUdN3100%3d&amp;kCx1AnS9%2fpWZQ40DXFvdEw%3d%3d=hFflUdN3100%3d&amp;uJovDxwdjMPoYv%2bAJvYtyA%3d%3d=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;FgPlIEJYlotS%2bYGoBi5olA%3d%3d=NHdURQburHA%3d&amp;d9Qjj0ag1Pd993jsyOJqFvmyB7X0CSQK=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;WGewmoAfeNR9xqBux0r1Q8Za60lavYmz=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;WGewmoAfeNQ16B2MHuCpMRKZMwaG1PaO=ctNJFf55vVA%3d","headline":"Local Government Reorganisation confirmed for 1 April 2028 - South Derbyshire will cease to exist as an independent council.","detail":"SR16 is listed as a strategic risk with Chief Executive ownership. The LGR decision has been formally confirmed and the council is assessing the operational and financial impact, with revised approach and workplan to be reviewed in Q2 2026.","category":"governance","matters":"LGR is an existential event affecting the council's ability to continue operations and service existing debt. For lenders, this creates uncertainty about counterparty stability through the merger. For finance directors, it requires major planning for service transition.","figures":"1 April 2028","quote":"At the time of updating this report the LGR decision has been confirmed. The impact will be assessed, and the approach/workplan will be reviewed and revised during quarter 2 to reflect the confirmed position.","material":true}],"editorial":null,"freshness":{"last_paper_iso":"2026-09-17"},"name":"South Derbyshire","daily_post":{"iso":"2026-09-24","since_iso":"2026-08-25","distress":false,"headline":"Multiple audit recommendations remain overdue, with moderate and low-risk issues still outstanding from 2021/22.","lead":"Unresolved audit actions from over three years ago suggest the council has persistent implementation challenges in addressing identified control weaknesses.","also":["4 other findings in this window"],"watch":null,"n_findings":5,"n_documents":0,"top_paper_title":"Audit and Governance - 24 June 2026","top_paper_url":"https://south-derbys.cmis.uk.com/South-Derbys/Document.ashx?czJKcaeAi5tUFL1DTL2UE4zNRBcoShgo=fFLZAbTfgaxD9sfozVo2RiXMHATyQm%2baNFg8BQRQPxd9jUf%2f%2bd9mKA%3d%3d&amp;rUzwRPf%2bZ3zd4E7Ikn8Lyw%3d%3d=pwRE6AGJFLDNlh225F5QMaQWCtPHwdhUfCZ%2fLUQzgA2uL5jNRG4jdQ%3d%3d&amp;mCTIbCubSFfXsDGW9IXnlg%3d%3d=hFflUdN3100%3d&amp;kCx1AnS9%2fpWZQ40DXFvdEw%3d%3d=hFflUdN3100%3d&amp;uJovDxwdjMPoYv%2bAJvYtyA%3d%3d=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;FgPlIEJYlotS%2bYGoBi5olA%3d%3d=NHdURQburHA%3d&amp;d9Qjj0ag1Pd993jsyOJqFvmyB7X0CSQK=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;WGewmoAfeNR9xqBux0r1Q8Za60lavYmz=ctNJFf55vVA%3d&amp;WGewmoAfeNQ16B2MHuCpMRKZMwaG1PaO=ctNJFf55vVA%3d","draft":true},"findings_total":29,"news_drafts_total":1}}